        "accession_number": "0001971213-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we continue to develop business opportunities, products, and services associated with NextGen TV (also known as ATSC 3.0) as discussed under Development of Next Generation Wireless Platform below.",
        "start_character": 34971,
        "end_character": 35181
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001971213-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001971213-26-000012-0e75e62c3c26789e",
        "accession_number": "0001971213-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Certain of our stations have entered into agreements with other stations in the same market, through which we provide programming and operating services pursuant to LMAs or provide sales and other operating services pursuant to outsourcing agreements, such as JSAs and SSAs.",
        "start_character": 48225,
        "end_character": 48499
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001971213-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001971213-26-000012-0e75e62c3c26789e",
        "accession_number": "0001971213-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to bring this technology to the market, we have partnered with technology leaders to develop broadcasting solutions and services in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 39017,
        "end_character": 39166
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001971213-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001971213-26-000012-0e75e62c3c26789e",
        "accession_number": "0001971213-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our stations also broadcast programming and other content provided by Tennis, and we provide access to certain events through our Tennis Channel streaming service, which is available to everyone in the United States and allows subscribers to select from another 10,000 hours of live and on-demand matches and award-winning content from short-form to films throughout the tennis season.",
        "start_character": 28077,
        "end_character": 28462
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001971213-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001971213-26-000012-0e75e62c3c26789e",
        "accession_number": "0001971213-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The majority of stations we own and operate, or to which we provide programming services, are UHF.",
        "start_character": 47370,
        "end_character": 47468
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001971213-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001971213-26-000012-0e75e62c3c26789e",
        "accession_number": "0001971213-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The programming that we provide on our primary channels consists of network provided programs, locally-produced news, local sporting events, programming from program service arrangements, syndicated entertainment programs, and internally originated programming.",
        "start_character": 7420,
        "end_character": 7681
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001971213-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001971213-26-000012-0e75e62c3c26789e",
        "accession_number": "0001971213-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also earn revenue by selling digital advertisements on third-party platforms, providing digital content to non-linear devices via websites, mobile, and social media advertisements, and providing digital marketing services.",
        "start_character": 10489,
        "end_character": 10714
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001971213-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001971213-26-000012-0e75e62c3c26789e",
        "accession_number": "0001971213-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed new ways to sell online, on mobile text messaging, social media advertising, and through audience extension services along with our traditional commercial broadcasting model, including streaming content on connected televisions and the launch of our podcast division.",
        "start_character": 33792,
        "end_character": 34077
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001971213-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001971213-26-000012-0e75e62c3c26789e",
        "accession_number": "0001971213-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We own, provide programming and operating services pursuant to local marketing agreements (“LMA”), or provide sales services and other non-programming operating services pursuant to other outsourcing agreements (such as joint sales agreements (“JSA”) and shared services agreements (“SSA”)) to 179 stations in 81 markets.",
        "start_character": 6271,
        "end_character": 6592
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001971213-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001971213-26-000012-0e75e62c3c26789e",
        "accession_number": "0001971213-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide certain non-programming related sales, operational, and administrative services to these stations pursuant to service agreements, such as JSAs and SSAs.",
